---
description: Write Stop bold and capitalized when it means a stop on a track
alwaysApply: true
---

# Stop means a track stop

When the word means a stop on a Membrae track, write it **Stop**: bold, capitalized. Plain stop means stopping an answer, a worker's turn, or the Stop button.

Never ask what "stop" means. If the user says "the stop is done", it is the track **Stop**.
